# The invite (#b=marrow&s=25&h=1) sets party.length=25, difficulty=heroic and
# unlocked=tierOf(marrow,25,heroic) before we ever see a screen. Backing out to
# home and pressing RAID re-settles the door setting against the now-open
# tier, which should already read 25/heroic without touching the dropdowns --
# confirm by screenshot rather than guessing from a label with no value in it.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
shot raidsetup
tap next
targets
shot classpick
tap class:shaman:elemental
state
targets
